      "example_text": "Input: nums = [1,-2,3,4]\nOutput: 10\nExplanation:\nOne way to maximize the total cost is by splitting [1, -2, 3, 4] into subarrays [1, -2, 3] and [4] . The total cost will be (1 + 2 + 3) + 4 = 10 .",
